<view class="login-page">
  <view class="login-content">
    <view class="brand"><view class="brand-mark">班</view><view><text class="brand-name">班达教师端</text><text class="brand-desc">班级事务，一触即达</text></view></view>
    <view class="welcome">
      <text class="welcome-title">连接教室，随时处理班级事务</text>
      <text class="welcome-desc">使用教师端生成的二维码登录，无需输入账号和密码。</text>
    </view>

    <view class="scan-panel">
      <view class="scan-icon">
        <view class="corner c1"></view><view class="corner c2"></view><view class="corner c3"></view><view class="corner c4"></view>
        <view class="scan-center"></view>
      </view>
      <text class="scan-title">扫描教师端二维码</text>
      <text class="scan-desc">在电脑教师端打开“账户管理”，选择“小程序登录”。</text>
      <button class="primary scan-button" bindtap="scanLogin" loading="{{scanning}}" disabled="{{scanning}}">{{scanning ? '正在读取' : '开始扫码'}}</button>
    </view>

    <view class="privacy-row">
      <view class="privacy-icon">✓</view>
      <text>登录凭证仅保存在当前微信设备，可在“我的”中退出。</text>
    </view>
  </view>
</view>
